{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17204","headline":"过张监阁老宅对酒奉酬见赠 · 权德舆","name":"过张监阁老宅对酒奉酬见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"里仁无外事，徐步一开颜。\n荆玉收难尽，齐竽喜暂闲。\n秋风倾菊酒，霁景下蓬山。\n不用投车辖，甘从倒载还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}